@agentclientprotocol/codex-acp 1.8.0
------------------------------------

Jig ships the official ACP adapter for native OpenAI Codex as an inert support
asset. It is selected only when the operator explicitly enables the native
Codex client; Jig does not include the Codex executable or its credentials.

Jig patches the pinned adapter to disable automatic model-based session titles.
Requested turns keep their reviewed model and count; deterministic fallback
titles remain. The patch also propagates native process failure and clears the
shutdown timer after native close. Forced termination cannot report a clean
adapter exit. See `packages/jig/patches/codex-acp@1.8.0.patch` and its companion
note for the correction and removal condition.

