pi-acp 0.0.33
-------------

Jig bundles the ACP adapter for native Pi as optional inert support. The
adapter is selected only when the operator explicitly enables Pi; Jig does not
include credentials or the operator-supplied native Pi executable and sibling
runtime-support files.

Jig carries a version-pinned dependency patch preserving failed RPC prompts,
assistant errors, cancellation, and token limits as distinct ACP results.
The patch is maintained at `packages/jig/patches/pi-acp@0.0.33.patch` in source;
the installed bundle includes that correction.

